{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>El</b> — The reason: he stated at the beginning, do not trust in human beings to save you, and do not trust in your wealth that it will stand for you in your distress. This is the meaning of חיל כי ינוב, like עשה לי את החיל הזה." "And the word ינוב means 'will increase,' from the root of תנובה. And he mentioned oppression and robbery because most of human wealth is made by one of these two ways." "And oppression — through deception and fraud." "And robbery — by force." "And the meaning of תהבלו — you add hevel upon hevel."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 62, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:33.516493124Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}